# Stage 2 — Meridian BDX query को reverse-engineer करवाओ

Meridian query को सिर्फ SQL query की तरह नहीं देखना है।

AI से बोलो इसे **Business Logic Specification** में convert करे।

उदाहरण:

```sql
CASE
    WHEN status = 'A' THEN 'ACTIVE'
    WHEN status = 'C' THEN 'CLOSED'
END AS policy_status
```

AI इसे convert करे:

```text
Rule ID: MRD-001

Target Column:
policy_status

Source:
status

Logic:
A → ACTIVE
C → CLOSED

Type:
Derived column / CASE mapping
```

Join:

```sql
LEFT JOIN customer c
ON p.customer_id = c.customer_id
```

convert हो:

```text
Rule ID: MRD-J01

Primary source:
policy

Joined source:
customer

Join type:
LEFT JOIN

Join condition:
policy.customer_id = customer.customer_id

Purpose:
Customer enrichment
```

यह intermediate representation बहुत powerful है।

